{% layout 'novinzo' %}

<nz-checkout-form
  store-id="{{ store.id }}"
  currency="{{ store.currencyIsoCode }}"
  data-island="nz-checkout-form"
  data-hydrate="eager"
>
  {% comment %}
    The questions the cart's products ask the buyer, from the Checkout questions app. Written
    inside the form, they show in its card among its own fields. It renders nothing for a store
    without the app, and for a cart that asks nothing.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% plugin_block "checkout-questions/checkout-questions@1" %}
</nz-checkout-form>
